# Cloverage's HTML form counts are the Clojure coverage source; a project
# LCOV report is only the fallback (crapper coverage.py percent_for).
project clojure
file reports/clojure/core.clj.html target/coverage/demo/core.clj.html
file reports/clojure/lcov.info target/coverage/lcov.info
arg --use-existing-coverage
